      "content": "thanks. those are good starting points. but i feel like some people would say mass concentration of data and power in just 4 or 5 companies is actually a huge risk to the whole system. like, if they control everything, they control the information ecosystem. can u give me a breakdown of the arguments that say we definitely NEED more antitrust regulation? i want to make sure i'm not ignoring the big problems people are actually worried about.",
